#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_skipStripping)
#: alkonlinequotesprofile.ui:260
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>For easier processing of the data returned by the online source, KMyMoney "
"usually strips unused parts before it is parsed with the regular "
"expressions. If matching of the fields relies on those items, then use this "
"option to turn stripping off.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The following items are usually removed by stripping:\n"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>HTML tags such as <b>&lt;tag&gt;</b></li>\n"
"<li>& encoded characters such as <b>&amp;nbsp;</b></li>\n"
"<li>duplicate whitespace</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Radi jednostavnije obrade podataka koje vraća internetski izvor, KMyMoney "
"obično uklanja neiskorištene dijelove prije obrade regularnim izrazima. Ako "
"podudaranje polja ovisi o tim stavkama, ovom mogućnošću isključite njihovo "
"uklanjanje.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Uklanjanjem se obično uklanjaju sljedeće stavke:\n"
"\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>HTML oznake, primjerice <b>&lt;tag&gt;</b></li>\n"
"<li>znakovi kodirani pomoću &, primjerice <b>&amp;nbsp;</b></li>\n"
"<li>višestruki razmaci</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_skipStripping)
#: alkonlinequotesprofile.ui:263
#, kde-format
msgid "Skip HTML stripping"
msgstr "Preskoči uklanjanje HTML-a"

